# ============================================
# Notes
# ============================================
# 1. After generating certificate, upload CSR to ZATCA portal
# 2. Get OTP from ZATCA and use it with: php artisan zatca:request-compliance-certificate {otp}
# 3. For production, change ZATCA_ENVIRONMENT=production and ZATCA_PRODUCTION=true
# 4. Update ZATCA_ORG_IDENTIFIER with your actual 15-digit organization identifier
# 5. Update organization details with your actual business information

